WEBVTT

00:06.950 --> 00:08.660
<b>Huh? Where’s Satoshi?</b>

00:15.200 --> 00:17.250
<b>Man, he’s so carefree.</b>

00:17.250 --> 00:18.750
<b>Oh, don’t blame him.</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:23.170
<b>Spending time relaxing with your Pokémon 
 is one of the great joys of being a trainer.</b>

00:23.170 --> 00:27.550
<b>When I’m done tidying up, 
 I’m gonna follow suit and have a nap with Koduck!</b>

00:30.550 --> 00:31.970
<b>Pikachu...</b>

00:35.310 --> 00:36.390
<b>What?!</b>

00:38.600 --> 00:41.060
<b>If you ask us “What?!”, “Pikachu?!”...</b>

00:41.060 --> 00:43.940
<b>We’ll answer out of 
 sympathy for the world!</b>

00:44.820 --> 00:47.190
<b>To protect the world from devastation.</b>

00:47.190 --> 00:49.570
<b>To preserve world peace.</b>

00:49.570 --> 00:52.370
<b>Championing the evils 
 of truth and love.</b>

00:52.370 --> 00:55.080
<b>We’re the lovely, charming villains.</b>

00:55.080 --> 00:56.330
<b>Musashi!</b>

00:56.330 --> 00:57.080
<b>Kojiro!</b>

00:57.450 --> 01:00.330
<b>The Team Rocket duo 
 soars through the galaxy!</b>

01:00.710 --> 01:04.040
<b>Like a white hole, 
 a white tomorrow awaits us!</b>

01:04.040 --> 01:05.920
<b>Just kidding, meow!</b>

01:07.050 --> 01:07.840
<b>Push.</b>

01:09.840 --> 01:11.090
<b>What’s the matter with you?!</b>

01:11.090 --> 01:13.390
<b>Nothing’s the matter 
 or the Matadogas or anything!</b>

01:13.390 --> 01:15.430
<b>Until we catch that cool Pikachu...</b>

01:15.430 --> 01:17.220
<b>...we’ll keep coming back, meow!</b>

01:17.640 --> 01:18.470
<b>Satoshi!</b>

01:18.470 --> 01:20.230
<b>I’ll be okay.</b>

01:20.230 --> 01:21.060
<b>Tsutarja!</b>

01:22.480 --> 01:24.060
<b>Leaf Storm!</b>

01:32.910 --> 01:33.950
<b>Pikachu!</b>

01:41.210 --> 01:44.330
<b><i>What an awful feeling!</i></b>

