03:26.890 --> 03:31.270
<b>It appears Pikachu was sent flying 
 along with Team Rocket.</b>

03:31.270 --> 03:32.690
<b>Huh, meow?</b>

03:52.090 --> 03:54.590
<b>Help, meow!</b>

04:22.660 --> 04:25.120
<b>We’ve ended up 
 pretty far away, meow.</b>

04:27.040 --> 04:28.410
<b>Hold on, meow!</b>

04:28.410 --> 04:31.880
<b>Let’s have a truce until we meet up 
 with our friends again, meow!</b>

04:33.630 --> 04:37.010
<b>I’m not lying, meow! 
 I’m being serious, meow...</b>

04:41.760 --> 04:46.770
<b>I’ll use him as much as I can, then once I meet up 
 with Musashi and Kojiro, we’ll nab him, meow.</b>

04:50.190 --> 04:53.020
<b>Huh, meow? 
 Hey, where are you going, meow?!{halfNEP}</b>

04:55.150 --> 04:57.360
<b>The brat boy’s headed this way, too?</b>

04:57.360 --> 04:59.280
<b>You can’t know that, meow!</b>

05:00.400 --> 05:02.280
<b>You can tell? How, meow?</b>

05:03.830 --> 05:05.620
<b>You don’t know how, 
 you just can?</b>

05:05.620 --> 05:07.370
<b>What does that <i>mean,</i> meow?!</b>

05:10.210 --> 05:12.040
<b>Pikachu!</b>

05:12.040 --> 05:15.920
<b>Hold on a sec. 
 Is this even the right way?</b>

05:15.920 --> 05:19.050
<b>Yeah. 
 Pikachu’s headed this way, too.</b>

05:19.050 --> 05:20.590
<b>How do you know that?{NEP nande wakaru no yo}</b>

05:20.590 --> 05:22.340
<b>I don’t know how, 
 I just do!{NEP}</b>

05:22.340 --> 05:23.140
<b>Huh?</b>

05:23.140 --> 05:25.680
<b>They can sense 
 each other’s thoughts.{ishindenshin... 'telepathy' seems too strong especially in a world where there are truly telepathic Pokemon}</b>

05:25.680 --> 05:27.010
<b>What’s that supposed to mean?</b>

05:27.010 --> 05:29.560
<b>I’m on my way, Pikachu!{NEP}</b>

05:33.560 --> 05:36.900
<b>H— Hey, wait, meow!</b>

05:41.070 --> 05:44.160
<b>I can’t run any more, meow...</b>

05:45.580 --> 05:48.080
<b>And I’m getting hungr—</b>

05:48.080 --> 05:50.960
<b>Huh, meow? What’s that?!</b>

05:50.960 --> 05:55.000
<b>Oran Berries, meow! 
 Time to dig inyarth!</b>

05:55.750 --> 05:58.250
<b>Those are my berries, meow!{Those are meow berries, meow!}</b>

05:58.250 --> 05:59.260
<b>Take this!{* kono...! like konoyarou}</b>

06:10.220 --> 06:11.180
<b>Ow, ow, ow!</b>

06:11.180 --> 06:12.850
<b>You take it from here, meow!</b>

06:28.160 --> 06:30.620
<b>Run, meow!</b>

06:34.370 --> 06:36.670
<b>They don’t give up, meow!</b>

06:37.630 --> 06:39.630
<b>There’s a cave over there, meow?</b>

06:40.630 --> 06:43.670
<b>Huh, meow?! 
 Wait for me, meow!</b>

07:05.860 --> 07:06.990
<b>Oran Berries.</b>

07:06.990 --> 07:08.240
<b>They’re charred.</b>

07:08.240 --> 07:10.160
<b>It was Pikachu’s 100,000 Volts.</b>

07:10.160 --> 07:12.330
<b>Which means 
 he went through here.</b>

07:14.540 --> 07:16.000
<b>This feather...</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:19.750
<b>Onisuzume.</b>

07:19.750 --> 07:22.590
<b>I get it. 
 They had a battle here...</b>

07:27.010 --> 07:28.970
<b>...and went in there.</b>

07:29.350 --> 07:30.140
<b>Let’s go.</b>

07:30.140 --> 07:30.640
<b>Okay.</b>

07:30.640 --> 07:31.390
<b>Right.</b>

07:33.390 --> 07:35.390
<b>I don’t have time 
 to battle you!</b>

07:35.390 --> 07:36.390
<b>Please let me through!</b>

07:49.570 --> 07:52.120
<b>Just give up on that hat, meow.</b>

07:52.830 --> 07:56.120
<b>Reuniting with our friends 
 is more important, meow.</b>

07:56.660 --> 07:58.500
<b>Pikachu!</b>

07:59.130 --> 08:03.130
<b>This is all so we can catch Pikachu, meow. 
 Guess I’ve got no choice.</b>

08:03.130 --> 08:05.760
<b>I’ll come with you, meow!</b>

08:26.740 --> 08:28.950
<b>What? You saw it, meow?</b>

08:40.420 --> 08:42.840
<b>It’s saying “Follow me!”, meow!</b>

08:48.260 --> 08:49.840
<b>But you’re{alt: it’s} too slow, meow!</b>

